<title>BELGIUM: ADVISORY - Belgian Belfox data delayed.</title>
<headline>ADVISORY - Belgian Belfox data delayed.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Belfox futures and options data is delayed. The fault is being investigated and further information will be issued when available.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
